#### **4. Session Listing Showed Expired Sessions (Bug: Admin Console Showed Sessions That Ended Long Ago)**

**Location:** `src/sessions.js`, line 9

**Problem:** The session listing only filtered out revoked families but didn't filter out families that had reached their effective expiry deadline.

**Fix:** Add expiry check to the filter so only truly live sessions are shown.

```javascript
// Before
return families
  .filter((f) => f.revokedAt === null)

// After
return families
  .filter((f) => f.revokedAt === null && now < effectiveDeadline(f, policy))
```

